?><!doctype html><html><head><title>Video Review Studio</title><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'><style>body{margin:0;background:#111827;color:white;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif}.wrap{max-width:1700px;margin:auto;padding:20px}.layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:18px}.panel{background:#0b1020;border:1px solid #263042;border-radius:18px;padding:18px}video{width:100%;max-height:72vh;background:#000;border-radius:14px}.btn{background:#c8a96e;color:#111;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;font-weight:900;margin:4px}select,textarea,input{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;padding:10px;margin:6px 0 12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #333;background:#111827;color:white}.hero h1{font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#c8a96e}</style></head><body><main class='wrap'><section class='hero'><h1>Video Review Studio</h1><p>Media-player foundation for Jessica's human editor mode.</p></section><div class='layout'><section class='panel'><form method='get'><select name='file' onchange='this.form.submit()'><?php foreach($files as $f):?><option value='<?=h($f)?>' <?=$f===$selected?'selected':''?>><?=h($f)?></option><?php endforeach;?></select></form><?php if($selected):?><video id='v' controls preload='metadata' src='/uploads/media/raw/<?=h($selected)?>'></video><p><button class='btn' onclick="mark('start')">Mark Start</button><button class='btn' onclick="mark('end')">Mark End</button><button class='btn' onclick='back()'>-5s</button><button class='btn' onclick='fwd()'>+5s</button></p><?php else:?><p>No videos found in /uploads/media/raw/.</p><?php endif;?></section><aside class='panel'><h2>Clip Notes</h2><label>Start</label><input id='start'><label>End</label><input id='end'><label>Hook / Moment</label><textarea rows='4'></textarea><label>Caption Fixes</label><textarea rows='5'></textarea><label>CTA</label><textarea rows='3'></textarea><button class='btn'>Save Notes Foundation</button><p>Next patch will save notes into Supabase and connect to Shorts Factory render jobs.</p></aside></div></main><script>const v=document.getElementById('v');function mark(id){if(v)document.getElementById(id).value=Math.round(v.currentTime*10)/10;}function back(){if(v)v.currentTime=Math.max(0,v.currentTime-5)}function fwd(){if(v)v.currentTime+=5}</script></body></html>